---
.title = "Against the tools it replaces",
.description = "What zanity finds that the linters it consolidates find, rule by rule, and how fast.",
.date = .date("2026-10-17T00:00:02"),
.layout = "page.shtml",
---

zanity replaces six linters. This page runs each of them through its own Python library, beside zanity, on the same code, and reports what each finds.
It is generated by `bench/parity/parity.py` on 2026-10-17, against zanity `7c4a2e5`; see [how to rerun it](#rerun).

# Summary

Each rule has a small fixture written to trigger it. A fixture counts only if the old tool fires on it. Green: zanity matches every rule. Amber: some. Red: none.

```=html
<div class="scoreboard">
<div class="card pass"><div class="card-name">nasa-lsp</div><div class="card-score">11<span>/11</span></div><div class="card-bar"><span style="width:100%"></span></div><div class="card-unit">rules matched</div></div>
<div class="card pass"><div class="card-name">testdesiderata</div><div class="card-score">38<span>/38</span></div><div class="card-bar"><span style="width:100%"></span></div><div class="card-unit">rules matched</div></div>
<div class="card partial"><div class="card-name">mockbuster</div><div class="card-score">4<span>/6</span></div><div class="card-bar"><span style="width:67%"></span></div><div class="card-unit">rules matched</div></div>
<div class="card pass"><div class="card-name">dddlint</div><div class="card-score">10<span>/10</span></div><div class="card-bar"><span style="width:100%"></span></div><div class="card-unit">rules matched</div></div>
<div class="card partial"><div class="card-name">bonsai</div><div class="card-score">8<span>/10</span></div><div class="card-bar"><span style="width:80%"></span></div><div class="card-unit">rules matched</div></div>
<div class="card pass"><div class="card-name">nouls</div><div class="card-score">30<span>/30</span></div><div class="card-bar"><span style="width:100%"></span></div><div class="card-unit">questions matched</div></div>
</div>
```

| Tool | Rules | Fixtures it fires on | zanity fires on | zanity misses |
| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |
| [nasa-lsp](https://github.com/benomahony/nasa-lsp) | 11 | 11 | [11/11 rules]($text.attrs('badge','pass')) | – |
| [testdesiderata](https://github.com/benomahony/testdesiderata) | 39 | 38 | [38/38 rules]($text.attrs('badge','pass')) | `FST003` |
| [mockbuster](https://github.com/benomahony/mockbuster) | 6 | 6 | [4/6 rules]($text.attrs('badge','partial')) | `mocker-fixture`, `monkeypatch-fixture` |
| [dddlint](https://github.com/benomahony/dddlint) | 12 | 10 | [10/10 rules]($text.attrs('badge','pass')) | `near-synonym`, `context-outlier` |
| bonsai | 11 | 10 | [8/10 rules]($text.attrs('badge','partial')) | `extractable-chunk`, `long-function` |
| [nouls](https://github.com/benomahony/nouls) | 505 | – | [30/30 questions]($text.attrs('badge','pass')) | – |

